---
// Mint — YSWS landing page
const title = "Mint — an Altoids-tin hardware YSWS";
const description = "Ship a hardware project sized to an Altoids tin, get a $75 grant plus the tin itself, and journal the build.";
---

<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="description" content={description} />
  <title>{title}</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Courier+Prime:wght@400;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
</head>
<body>
<div class="crt-screen">
<div class="crt-content">
<header>
  <div class="topbar">
    <a href="#" class="logo"><span class="dot"></span>MINT</a>
    <nav>
      <a href="#deal">The deal</a>
      <a href="#fits">What fits</a>
      <a href="#how">How it works</a>
      <a href="#submit" class="cta-small">Submit</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="wrap">
  <section class="hero" style="border-top:none;">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">A Hack Club YSWS · you ship, we ship</p>
      <h1>Build something that fits<br>in an <span class="accent">Altoids tin.</span></h1>
      <p class="lede">Mint is a hardware challenge for small spaces. Ship a project sized to a real Altoids tin, journal how you built it, and we'll send you the tin itself plus a $75 grant to fill it.</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a href="#submit" class="btn btn-primary">Start your project →</a>
        <a href="https://slack.com/archives/C0BK69GFA0Z" class="btn btn-ghost">Join #mint on Slack</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tin-stage">
      <div>
        <div class="tin-photo-frame">
          <img src="/mintysws/altoids-tin.png" alt="An Altoids tin" />
        </div>
        <p class="spec-tag">Fits within <span>3.75" × 2.375" × 0.8"</span><br>the footprint of a real Altoids tin</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<div class="wrap">
  <section id="deal">
    <p class="section-kicker">The exchange</p>
    <h2>You ship, we ship.</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">Straightforward trade: you build and document something that lives inside an Altoids tin, we cover the cost of making it happen.</p>
    <div class="deal-grid">
      <div class="deal-card">
        <h3>You provide</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>A hardware project that fits inside an Altoids tin</li>
          <li>A GitHub journal of the design process</li>
          <li>No timelapses needed — just real progress logs</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="swap-icon">⇄</div>
      <div class="deal-card">
        <h3>We provide</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>An Altoids tin to build inside</li>
          <li>A $75 grant on completion</li>
          <li>A spot in the #mint community</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<div class="wrap">
  <section id="fits">
    <p class="section-kicker">Scope</p>
    <h2>If it's contained in the Altoids tin, it counts.</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">Beginner or advanced, simple or clever — here's the kind of thing past builders have shipped in similar formats. Use these as a starting point, not a limit.</p>
    <div class="fits-grid">
      <a href="https://www.instructables.com/Pocket-Sized-Synthesizer/" class="fit-card">
        <div class="icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><rect x="3" y="9" width="18" height="8" rx="1.5"/><path d="M6 9V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2M6 17v3M18 17v3"/><circle cx="9" cy="13" r="1.5"/><circle cx="13.5" cy="13" r="1.5"/><circle cx="18" cy="13" r="1.5"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Micro synth</h4>
        <p>A pocket-sized noisemaker — oscillators, buttons, maybe a speaker crammed into the lid.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="https://jackw01.github.io/pi-tin/" class="fit-card">
        <div class="icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><rect x="4" y="3" width="16" height="18" rx="2"/><rect x="7" y="6" width="10" height="7" rx="1"/><circle cx="9" cy="17" r="1.2"/><circle cx="12" cy="17" r="1.2"/><circle cx="15" cy="17" r="1.2"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Pocket game</h4>
        <p>A tiny screen and a couple of buttons is all it takes for a game you can carry anywhere.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="https://hackaday.io/project/205598-altoids-tin-mini-cyberdeck" class="fit-card">
        <div class="icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><rect x="3" y="6" width="18" height="12" rx="2"/><path d="M7 10v4M11 10v4M15 10h3"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Mini cyberdeck</h4>
        <p>A portable computing rig for hacking, tinkering, and getting work done anywhere.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<div class="wrap">
  <section id="how">
    <p class="section-kicker">Process</p>
    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step">
        <span class="num">01</span>
        <h4>Get the spec</h4>
        <p>Your build envelope is fixed: 3.75" × 2.375" × 0.8". Everything else is up to you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <span class="num">02</span>
        <h4>Design</h4>
        <p>Sketch it, prototype it, design it. Short and scrappy beats big and stalled.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <span class="num">03</span>
        <h4>Journal on GitHub</h4>
        <p>Log your progress in a JOURNAL.md file in your repository. No timelapses required.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <span class="num">04</span>
        <h4>Ship it</h4>
        <p>Submit when it's done. We send the $75 grant and your Altoids tin.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<div class="wrap">
  <section>
    <div class="why">
      <blockquote>Mint is a "fresh" challenge in hardware — a short break from the big projects everyone's been slaving away on.</blockquote>
      <div class="why-copy">
        <p>Most people building lately have gravitated toward big, extravagant projects. Those can wear on you mentally.</p>
        <p>Mint is a lower-stakes, lower-hour-count alternative — something a beginner or an advanced builder can pick up, finish, and actually feel good about shipping.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<div class="wrap">
  <section id="submit">
    <p class="section-kicker">Ready?</p>
    <h2>Submit your project</h2>
    <div class="submit-panel">
      <p>Fill out the form below once your project is built and journaled. Have questions first? Drop them in <a href="https://slack.com/archives/C0BK69GFA0Z" style="color:var(--mint);">#mint</a>.</p>
      <div class="form-embed">
        <iframe
          src="https://form.fillout.com/t/your-fillout-form-id"
          title="Mint submission form"
          loading="lazy"
        ></iframe>
      </div>
      <p class="form-note">↑ replace the Fillout form URL with your live form before publishing</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    Mint · a Hack Club YSWS · <a href="https://slack.com/archives/C0BK69GFA0Z">#mint on Slack</a>
  </div>
</footer>
</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>

<style>

  :root {
    --bg: #f5e6d3;
    --ink: #2a1810;
    --ink-soft: #5c4033;
    --line: rgba(42, 24, 16, 0.15);
    --red: #d41e3a;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: #1a1410;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace;
    line-height: 1.6;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding: 12px;
  }

  .crt-screen {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1200px;
    background: #1a1410;
    border: 30px solid #3d2817;
    border-radius: 30px;
    box-shadow: 
      0 0 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8),
      inset 0 0 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5),
      inset 0 0 0 8px #2a1f15;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .crt-screen::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, transparent 0%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4) 100%);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 100;
  }

  .crt-screen::after {
    content: '';
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(
      0deg,
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15),
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15) 1px,
      transparent 1px,
      transparent 2px
    );
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 99;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .crt-screen::before {
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, transparent 0%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15) 100%);
    }

    .crt-screen::after {
      background: repeating-linear-gradient(
        0deg,
        rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05),
        rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05) 2px,
        transparent 2px,
        transparent 4px
      );
    }
  }

  .crt-content {
    background: var(--bg);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    padding: 36px 28px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  header {
    position: sticky;
    top: 40px;
    z-index: 50;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--bg), rgba(245, 230, 211, 0.95));
    border-bottom: 3px dashed var(--red);
    padding: 20px 28px;
    margin: 0 -28px 40px -28px;
    width: calc(100% + 56px);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .topbar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 40px;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .logo {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--ink);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .logo .dot {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: var(--red);
  }

  .topbar nav {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 24px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .topbar nav a {
    font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--ink);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }

  .topbar nav a:hover { 
    border-bottom-color: var(--red);
  }

  .topbar .cta-small {
    background: var(--red);
    color: var(--bg);
    padding: 12px 20px;
    border-radius: 0;
    border: 2px solid var(--red);
    font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    text-decoration: none;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .topbar .cta-small:hover {
    background: #b01a31;
    border-color: #b01a31;
    box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 rgba(176, 26, 49, 0.3);
  }

  .wrap {
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .hero {
    padding: 40px 0 60px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.4fr;
    gap: 60px;
    border-bottom: 3px dashed var(--line);
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .hero > div:first-child {
    text-align: left;
  }

  .tin-stage {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  .tin-stage::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    right: -180px;
    width: 280px;
    height: 280px;
    background: var(--red);
    clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 61% 35%, 98% 35%, 68% 57%, 79% 91%, 50% 70%, 21% 91%, 32% 57%, 2% 35%, 39% 35%);
    opacity: 0.15;
    z-index: -1;
  }

  .tin-photo-frame {
    position: relative;
    width: 520px;
    height: 520px;
    padding: 0;
    border: none;
    background: transparent;
    box-shadow: none;
  }

  .tin-photo-frame img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .spec-tag {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .spec-tag span { color: var(--red); }

  .eyebrow {
    font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--red);
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 44px;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  h1 .accent {
    color: var(--red);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .lede {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 45ch;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .hero-ctas { 
    display: flex; 
    gap: 12px; 
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn {
    font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 14px 20px;
    border-radius: 0;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    cursor: pointer;
    white-space: nowrap;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .btn:hover { 
    box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 rgba(42, 24, 16, 0.2);
  }

  .btn:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--red);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--red);
    color: var(--bg);
    border-color: var(--red);
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: #b01a31;
    border-color: #b01a31;
    box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 rgba(212, 30, 58, 0.2);
  }

  .btn-ghost {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--ink);
    border-color: var(--ink);
  }

  .btn-ghost:hover {
    background: rgba(212, 30, 58, 0.1);
    border-color: var(--red);
    color: var(--red);
  }

  section {
    padding: 40px 0;
    border-bottom: 3px dashed var(--line);
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    width: 100%;
    text-align: center;
  }

  section:last-of-type {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  h2 {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 36px;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .section-kicker {
    font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--red);
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .section-intro {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 55ch;
    margin: 0 auto 28px;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .deal-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .deal-card {
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
    border-radius: 0;
    padding: 20px;
    box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 rgba(42, 24, 16, 0.1);
    position: relative;
  }

  .deal-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -12px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    background: var(--red);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--bg);
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .deal-card h3 {
    font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    color: var(--red);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .deal-card ul { 
    margin: 0; 
    padding: 0; 
    list-style: none; 
  }

  .deal-card li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 8px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 13px;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .deal-card li:first-child { 
    border-top: none; 
    padding-top: 0; 
  }

  .deal-card li::before { 
    content: "▸"; 
    color: var(--red); 
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .swap-icon {
    display: none;
  }

  .fits-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .fit-card {
    display: block;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 2px solid var(--red);
    border-radius: 0;
    padding: 18px;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    position: relative;
  }

  .fit-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -10px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    background: var(--red);
    clip-path: circle(50%);
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .fit-card:hover {
    transform: none;
    background: #f5e6d3;
    border-color: var(--ink);
    box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 rgba(212, 30, 58, 0.15);
  }

  .fit-card .icon {
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .fit-card h4 {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .fit-card p { 
    margin: 0; 
    color: var(--ink-soft); 
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .steps {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .step {
    padding: 16px;
    border: 2px solid var(--red);
    background: transparent;
    position: relative;
  }

  .step::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -12px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    background: var(--red);
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .step .num {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .step h4 { 
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 16px;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .step p { 
    margin: 0; 
    color: var(--ink-soft); 
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .why {
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
    border-radius: 0;
    padding: 28px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
    box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 rgba(42, 24, 16, 0.1);
  }

  .why blockquote {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 0;
    border-left: none;
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .why .why-copy p { 
    margin: 0 0 12px; 
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .submit-panel {
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
    border-radius: 0;
    padding: 28px;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 rgba(42, 24, 16, 0.1);
  }

  .submit-panel p { 
    color: var(--ink-soft); 
    max-width: 55ch; 
    margin: 0 auto 24px;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .form-embed {
    background: #ede0cd;
    border: 2px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    min-height: 420px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .form-embed iframe {
    width: 100%;
    height: 520px;
    border: none;
  }

  .form-note {
    font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin-top: 12px;
  }

  footer {
    padding: 28px 0 0;
    text-align: center;
    font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    border-top: 3px dashed var(--line);
  }

  footer a { 
    color: var(--red); 
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  footer a:hover { 
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

